  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable rural development for improved livelihoods in less developed regions of Azerbaijan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to support these less developed districts towards socio-economic recovery and resilience, with a focus on inclusive and sustainable growth. Growth will be accelerated by  br 
i) increasing the competitiveness and supporting the development of selected value chains, ensuring environmental sustainability of all stages of the Farm to Fork (F2F) and  br 
ii) improving the community infrastructure of rural areas for promoting employment generation and social inclusion of youth, women, and other vulnerable populations. Grants will be deployed across communities, value chains and stakeholder types to catalyze this growth, with a focus on social inclusion and climate-resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
